{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search yield pools"},"description":"Find DeFi yield pools (lending, vaults, liquidity, staking) by token, chain, protocol, APY and TVL. Returns a ranked table with pool ids. Rates are fractions (0.05 = 5%). Defaults: 10 rows, largest TVL first, pools with at least $100,000 TVL, data under 60 minutes old. Stablecoin filters check token labels, not peg safety. Page with the returned cursor.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cursor":{"description":"nextCursor from the previous page. Repeat the same query and limit exactly.","maxLength":4096,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$","type":"string"},"limit":{"default":10,"description":"Rows to return, 1-50 (default 10).","maximum":50,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"query":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Filters. Omit for the whole catalogue (still limited to pools with TVL of at least $100K).","properties":{"chains":{"description":"Chain names (case-insensitive exact match), e.g. [\"Ethereum\",\"Base\",\"Arbitrum\",\"Solana\"].","items":{"maxLength":100,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":200,"type":"array"},"direction":{"description":"Sort direction (default \"desc\").","enum":["asc","desc"],"type":"string"},"exitAvailableOnly":{"description":"Only pools with evidence that withdrawals are available.","type":"boolean"},"freshness":{"description":"Data age rule. \"retrieved\" (default): retrieved within maxAgeMinutes. \"observed\": the source must state when it measured the rate. \"any\": include old quotes.","enum":["retrieved","observed","any"],"type":"string"},"maxAgeMinutes":{"description":"Maximum data age in minutes for the freshness rule (default 60). It can only shorten the window: each rate also expires after its own time-to-live (usually 60 minutes). To include older quotes use freshness \"any\".","maximum":10080,"minimum":1,"type":"number"},"maxApy":{"description":"Maximum total APY. A fraction, not a percentage: 0.05 means 5%, 0.5 means 50%.","maximum":1000,"minimum":-1,"type":"number"},"maxBaseApy":{"description":"Maximum base APY. A fraction, not a percentage: 0.05 means 5%, 0.5 means 50%.","maximum":1000,"minimum":-1,"type":"number"},"maxRewardApy":{"description":"Maximum reward-token APY, e.g. 0 for pools paying no reward tokens. A fraction, not a percentage: 0.05 means 5%, 0.5 means 50%.","maximum":1000,"minimum":-1,"type":"number"},"maxTvlUsd":{"description":"Maximum total value locked in USD.","maximum":1000000000000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"minApy":{"description":"Minimum total APY. A fraction, not a percentage: 0.05 means 5%, 0.5 means 50%.","maximum":1000,"minimum":-1,"type":"number"},"minBaseApy":{"description":"Minimum base APY (organic yield, excluding reward tokens). A fraction, not a percentage: 0.05 means 5%, 0.5 means 50%.","maximum":1000,"minimum":-1,"type":"number"},"minCoverage":{"description":"Minimum share (0-100) of assessment checks with evidence.","maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"minRewardApy":{"description":"Minimum reward-token APY. A fraction, not a percentage: 0.05 means 5%, 0.5 means 50%.","maximum":1000,"minimum":-1,"type":"number"},"minScore":{"description":"Minimum experimental assessment score 0-100. Few pools have reviewed evidence, so this usually returns nothing.","maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"minTvlUsd":{"description":"Minimum total value locked in USD. Defaults to 100,000 on this server; pass 0 to include tiny pools.","maximum":1000000000000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"protocols":{"description":"Protocol slugs (case-insensitive exact match), e.g. [\"aave-v3\",\"morpho-blue\",\"compound-v3\"]. Use search for partial names.","items":{"maxLength":100,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":200,"type":"array"},"providers":{"description":"Data feed: \"pool-feed\" (lending, liquidity and staking pools) or \"vault-feed\" (auto-compounding vaults).","items":{"enum":["pool-feed","vault-feed"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":2,"type":"array"},"search":{"description":"Words that must all appear in the pool symbol, protocol, chain, market label or token address, e.g. \"usdc\", \"steth\", \"aave usdt\".","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"singleAssetOnly":{"description":"Only single-asset pools (no LP pairs, so no impermanent loss from a pair).","type":"boolean"},"sort":{"description":"Sort field. Default \"tvl\" (largest pools first); use \"apy\" for the highest quoted APY first.","enum":["apy","tvl","base","reward","name"],"type":"string"},"stablecoinOnly":{"description":"Only pools whose assets are all recognised stablecoins (single or pairs). Labels only; says nothing about peg safety.","type":"boolean"},"stablecoinPairOnly":{"description":"Only pools pairing two or more recognised stablecoins, e.g. USDC-USDT.","type":"boolean"},"strategies":{"description":"Pool type: lending markets, vaults, liquidity (DEX LP) pools or staking.","items":{"enum":["lending","vault","liquidity","staking","unknown"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":5,"type":"array"}},"type":"object"}},"type":"object"},"name":"search_pools","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"asOf":{"maxLength":24,"type":"string"},"catalogueRevision":{"maxLength":256,"type":"string"},"collectedAt":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":24,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"limit":{"maximum":50,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"limitations":{"items":{"maxLength":2000,"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"nextCursor":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":4096,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"notes":{"items":{"maxLength":600,"type":"string"},"maxItems":10,"type":"array"},"rows":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"address":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":512,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"apy":{"ad